{
  "text": "```verilog\nmodule data_sync #(\n    parameter STAGES = 2,\n    parameter DWIDTH = 8\n)(\n    input                  clk,\n    input                  rstn,\n    input  [DWIDTH-1:0]    din,\n    input                  dready_i,\n    output reg [DWIDTH-1:0] dout,\n    output reg             dready_o\n);\n\n    localparam SYNC_STAGES = (STAGES < 2) ? 2 : STAGES;\n\n    reg [SYNC_STAGES-1:0] dready_sync;\n    reg [SYNC_STAGES-1:0] din_sync [0:DWIDTH-1];\n\n    integer i;\n\n    always @(posedge clk or negedge rstn) begin\n        if (!rstn) begin\n            dready_sync <= {SYNC_STAGES{1'b0}};\n            for (i = 0; i < DWIDTH; i = i + 1)\n                din_sync[i] <= {SYNC_STAGES{1'b0}};\n        end else begin\n            dready_sync <= {dready_sync[SYNC_STAGES-2:0], dready_i};\n            for (i = 0; i < DWIDTH; i = i + 1)\n                din_sync[i] <= {din_sync[i][SYNC_STAGES-2:0], din[i]};\n        end\n    end\n\n    always @(posedge clk or negedge rstn) begin\n        if (!rstn) begin\n            dout <= {DWIDTH{1'b0}};\n            dready_o <= 1'b0;\n        end else begin\n            dout <= din_sync[SYNC_STAGES-1];\n            dready_o <= dready_sync[SYNC_STAGES-1];\n        end\n    end\n\nendmodule\n```<|im_end|>",
